  "Full_Content": "<p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">General Studies (Paper - 1) 2023</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q1. Explain the role of geographical factors towards the development of Ancient India.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q2. What was the difference between Mahatma Gandhi and Rabindranath Tagore in their approach towards education and nationalism?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q3. Bring out the socio-economic effects of the introduction of railways in different countries of the world.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q4. Discuss the consequence of Climate change on the food security in tropical countries.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q5. Why is the world today confronted with a crisis of availability of and access to freshwater resources?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q6. How are the fjords formed? Why do they constitute some of the most picturesque areas of the world?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">—</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q7. Why is the South-West Monsoon called ‘Purvaiya’ (easterly) in Bhojpur Region? How has this directional seasonal wind system influenced the cultured ethos of the region?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q8. Do you think marriage as a sacrament is losing its value in Modern India?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q9.Explain why suicide among young women is increasing in Indian society.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q10. Child cuddling is now being replaced by mobile phones. Discuss its impact on the socialization of children.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 150 words) | 10 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q11. What are the main features of Vedic society and religion? Do you think some of the features are still prevailing in Indian society?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q12. What were the major technological changes introduced during the Sultanate period? How did those technological changes influence Indian society?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q13. How did the colonial rule affect the tribals in India and what was the tribal response to the colonial oppression?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q14. Comment on the resource potentials of the long coastline of India and highlight the status of natural hazard preparedness in these areas.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q15. Identify and discuss the factors responsible for diversity of natural vegetation in India. Assess the significance of wildlife sanctuaries in rain forest regions of India.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q16. Why did human development fail to keep pace with economic development in India?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q17. From being a net food importer in the 1960's, India has emerged as a net food exporter to the world. Provide Reasons.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q18. Does urbanization lead to more segregation and/or marginalization of the poor in Indian metropolises?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q19. Why is caste identity in India both fluid and static?</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">—</p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Q20. Discuss the impact of post-liberal economy on ethnic identity and communalism.</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">(Answer in 250 words) | 15 Marks</p><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong>Answer:</strong></p><div style=\"height: 12px;\"></div><p class=\"text-stone-800 text-base md:text-lg text-left\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;\">---</p><d